    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tikus Tales</strong> is a whimsical 3D platformer with a heavy focus on boss battles, starring two courageous mice, Suki and Tuki. When twelve rebellious animals stage a coup and imprison the Chinese Zodiac, only the mice manage to escape. Now, it's up to them to travel across a magical, Southeast Asia-inspired world\u2014jumping, throwing, and battling their way through diverse environments\u2014to restore balance to the Zodiac.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/3626324ae429f869cf1db6160c067676.poster.avif?t=1744127696\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/3626324ae429f869cf1db6160c067676.webm?t=1744127696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/3626324ae429f869cf1db6160c067676.mp4?t=1744127696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Tikus Tales</i> blends stylized low-poly visuals with fast-paced, lighthearted combat and creative platforming sequences. Each boss battle is a multi-phase showdown\u2014expect sudden twists like flooding arenas, chase sequences, and ever-changing rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/baeaca61dcd0ef96386b2d6b92d6d3db.poster.avif?t=1744127696\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/baeaca61dcd0ef96386b2d6b92d6d3db.webm?t=1744127696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/baeaca61dcd0ef96386b2d6b92d6d3db.mp4?t=1744127696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With charm, humor, and a fresh twist on familiar legends, <i>Tikus Tales</i> offers a delightfully chaotic adventure full of surprises and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/b3437e4f526b9f364435152494d8aa1c.poster.avif?t=1744127696\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/b3437e4f526b9f364435152494d8aa1c.webm?t=1744127696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/b3437e4f526b9f364435152494d8aa1c.mp4?t=1744127696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tikus Tales</strong> is a whimsical 3D platformer with a heavy focus on boss battles, starring two courageous mice, Suki and Tuki. When twelve rebellious animals stage a coup and imprison the Chinese Zodiac, only the mice manage to escape. Now, it's up to them to travel across a magical, Southeast Asia-inspired world\u2014jumping, throwing, and battling their way through diverse environments\u2014to restore balance to the Zodiac.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/3626324ae429f869cf1db6160c067676.poster.avif?t=1744127696\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/3626324ae429f869cf1db6160c067676.webm?t=1744127696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/3626324ae429f869cf1db6160c067676.mp4?t=1744127696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Tikus Tales</i> blends stylized low-poly visuals with fast-paced, lighthearted combat and creative platforming sequences. Each boss battle is a multi-phase showdown\u2014expect sudden twists like flooding arenas, chase sequences, and ever-changing rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/baeaca61dcd0ef96386b2d6b92d6d3db.poster.avif?t=1744127696\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/baeaca61dcd0ef96386b2d6b92d6d3db.webm?t=1744127696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/baeaca61dcd0ef96386b2d6b92d6d3db.mp4?t=1744127696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With charm, humor, and a fresh twist on familiar legends, <i>Tikus Tales</i> offers a delightfully chaotic adventure full of surprises and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/b3437e4f526b9f364435152494d8aa1c.poster.avif?t=1744127696\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/b3437e4f526b9f364435152494d8aa1c.webm?t=1744127696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/b3437e4f526b9f364435152494d8aa1c.mp4?t=1744127696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Tikus Tales is a colorful 3D platformer featuring Suki and Tuki\u2014two daring mice on a quest to defeat rebellious creatures and free the imprisoned Zodiac guardians. Face off in multi-phase boss battles filled with combat, platforming twists, and charm!",
